2:Te84,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Nothing. You give us your name, email and phone number, and we send you the access link. There is no card, no trial that converts into a charge, and nothing to cancel later."},"name":"What's the catch? Why is it free?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Because we build Shopify apps, and the people who get value from this course tend to be exactly the people our apps are built for. Teaching the thinking first is a better introduction than an ad. You are never obliged to install anything."},"name":"So what do you get out of it?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Your name, email and phone number, used to send you access and occasional updates about the course. We do not sell your details to anyone. You can unsubscribe from any email, and ask us to delete your record entirely, at any time."},"name":"What will you do with my details?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We build and run Shopify apps used by real merchants, and we see the conversion and order-value data those stores produce. This course is the reasoning behind that work, written down in the order it is actually useful."},"name":"Who is teaching it?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It is platform-agnostic in principle and Shopify-specific in the examples. The equation, the research, the offer design and the measurement all transfer. The click-by-click walkthroughs are filmed in Shopify."},"name":"Do I need to be on Shopify?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"None. If you have not launched, the early modules are the ones that decide whether your store works at all — research, offer, positioning, product page — and you will be making those decisions from a much better position than most people do. The measurement and paid traffic modules will be theory until you have visitors, and they will be waiting when you do."},"name":"I have not launched yet. Is this still for me?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It should not be. Everything is in plain English, and where a term is unavoidable it gets defined the first time it appears. If you have run a store for a few years you will move faster through the first two modules, but the sequencing and the measurement material tend to be new to most people."},"name":"Is it too basic if I already sell a bit, or too advanced if I don't?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It is self-paced and nothing expires, so it takes as long as you want it to. The modules are short enough to fit around a working day, and you can stop after the ones that apply to you and come back to the rest later."},"name":"How long does it take?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Access does not expire and neither do the updates. When a module is refilmed you get the new version automatically."},"name":"Is access really lifetime?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. The course teaches the reasoning, and the reasoning applies whatever tools you use. Where an Edge app is the fastest way to implement something we will say so, and we will also tell you how to do it without one."},"name":"Do I have to use Edge apps to apply this?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, and it is a common way to use it. The templates and teardown format are built to be used on client stores, not just your own. Send your team the link."},"name":"Can my whole team sign up?"}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Course\",\"description\":\"A free ten-module ecommerce growth course for beginners and growing stores. Customer research, offers, product pages, checkout, order value, traffic and retention — in plain English, in the order they matter.\",\"name\":\"The Edge Growth Course\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"price\":0,\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\"},\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Edgecoms\",\"url\":\"https://course.edgecoms.com/\"},\"url\":\"https://course.edgecoms.com/\"}"},"type":"application/ld+json"}],["$","script",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"},"type":"application/ld+json"}],"$L3","$L4","$L5","$L6"],["$L7"],"$L8"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"71kou0MXiTteIYIkVXK-O"}
